        "wikipedia.en:Vitamin_C" ;
    rdfs:label "vitamin C" ;
    definition: "Any member of a group of vitamers that belong to the chemical structural class called butenolides that exhibit biological activity against vitamin C deficiency in animals. The vitamers include <small>L</small>-ascorbic acid and its salt, ionized and oxidized forms." ;
